== Origin of the logic ==

Spyhound is a Kotlin reimplementation of the detection logic of the
Zero Breach Toolkit (Apache License 2.0):
https://github.com/interplains/Zero-Breach-Toolkit

== Indicator sources ==

The indicators are listed in app/src/main/assets/iocs/sources.json. Each
source is pinned to a fixed commit and verified by SHA-256 before use.

